    "notes": {
        "scope": "Default CSVformat=tracking and hierarchical ConvNextBase V6. Each row is a detected/classified instance. Filename stems derive from the input sequence.",
        "confidence": "CL taxaConf is classifier probability multiplied by 100. HI Conf1/2/3 contain classifier probabilities, not YOLO detector scores.",
        "classes": "CL taxaId adds one to the selected classifier index. HI LabelId fields retain classifier indices. These are not the detector class vocabulary.",
        "coordinates": "CL x1,y1,x2,y2 are pixel corners in the processed frame; frame preprocessing and motion alignment must be retained with the results.",
